title: "NPSS-Enhancer: Perturbation-Stable Pivot Denoising"
abstract: "v2.9 frequency quality profile (soft four-view modulation); Four-view invariant feature discovery (energy/frequency/morphology/structure) with target 15 dB noise-floor control; Training-free perturbation-stable pivot denoising with multi-stat Gmin intersection, a full-band 48k path with stereo, low-band protection, and soft cross-region topology, pivot completion, and high/low contribution roles, and energy/SNR weighting, fast mode, and stereo parallel, a SpecSub backend, and an optional NMF speech blend."
